      <cyrillic>хулгах</cyrillic>
      <transcript>XULAΓU-</transcript>
      <definition>[= xoluγu;-, cf. xulaγaila-] v. t. To steal, rob; to pillage, sack.</definition>
      <page>984</page>
      <examples>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠬᠣᠯᠠᠭᠣᠭᠴᠢ ᠺᠦᠮᠦᠨ</unicode>
          <transcript>--γci kymyn</transcript>
          <definition> Thief.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠬᠣᠯᠠᠭᠣᠵᠤ ᠬᠤᠳᠠᠯᠳᠤᠨ ᠥᠭᠺᠦ</unicode>
          <transcript>--zu xudaldun ogky</transcript>
          <definition> To sell surreptitiously, sell stolen goods or loot</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠴᠢᠺᠢ ᠪᠡᠨ ᠳᠠᠷᠤᠵᠤ ᠬᠣᠩᠬᠤ ᠎ᠶᠢ ᠬᠣᠯᠠᠭᠣᠬᠣ</unicode>
          <transcript>ciki ben daruzu xongxu ji --xu</transcript>
          <definition> To steal a ben with one's ears stopped up (thinking that others cannot hear it either), (Chinese and Mongolian locution).</definition>
        </example>
      </examples>
